Title: signal-hook-registry: accept AROS signals without an info payload
Source: crates.io signal-hook-registry 1.4.6
SHA256: b2a4719bff48cee6b39d12c020eeb490953ad2443b7055bd0b21fca26bd8c28b
Date: 2026-11-20
Status: local

ABIv1 raise can pass null siginfo. Dispatch plain callbacks without
metadata and reject registrations which require it. Chain the prior
handler with its original arguments. Uses rust-aros ABIv1 bindings.
Validation: macOS cargo check, x86_64 ABIv1 compile/link and native
SIGUSR2 registration, dispatch, previous-handler chaining and removal.

